#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Troubleshoot notifications"
msgstr "알림 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost notifications you receive depend on your `Mattermost "
"preferences <#check-your-mattermost-preferences>`__, the `Mattermost "
"client <#check-your-mattermost-client-settings>`__ you're using, and the "
"`operating system (OS) <#check-your-operating-system-settings>`__ you're "
"running Mattermost on."
msgstr ""
"수신하는 OKR.BEST 알림은 `OKR.BEST 환경 설정 <#check-your-mattermost-"
"preferences>`__, 사용 중인 `OKR.BEST 클라이언트 <#check-your-mattermost-"
"client-settings>`__, 그리고 OKR.BEST를 실행하는 `운영 체제(OS) <#check-your-"
"operating-system-settings>`__\\ 에 따라 달라집니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:10
msgid "Send yourself a test notification"
msgstr "자신에게 테스트 알림 보내기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:12
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.3, you can send yourself a test notification by "
"selecting **Settings** |gear|, and going to the **Notifications** "
"options."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v10.3부터 **설정** |gear|\\ 을 선택한 후 **알림** 옵션으로 이동하여 "
"자신에게 테스트 알림을 보낼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
msgstr "설정 아이콘을 사용하여 OKR.BEST 사용자 경험을 사용자 지정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:14
msgid ""
"Under **Troubleshooting notifications** select the **Send a test "
"notification** option. If notifications are working, you'll receive a "
"system-bot direct message in Mattermost confirming that notifications are"
" working."
msgstr ""
"**알림 문제 해결** 아래에서 **테스트 알림 보내기** 옵션을 선택하세요. 알림이 "
"정상적으로 작동하면 알림이 작동 중임을 확인하는 시스템 봇 개인 메시지를 "
"OKR.BEST에서 받게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you don't receive a system-bot direct message, see the following "
"sections for troubleshooting steps you can follow to ensure you're "
"receiving the notifications you want."
msgstr ""
"시스템 봇 개인 메시지를 받지 못한 경우, 원하는 알림을 받을 수 있도록 따라 할 수 "
"있는 문제 해결 단계는 다음 섹션을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:19
msgid "Check your Mattermost preferences"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 환경 설정 확인"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:21
msgid ""
"Start by ensuring that your Mattermost preferences have notifications "
"enabled."
msgstr "먼저 OKR.BEST 환경 설정에서 알림이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:25
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:35
msgid "Select **Settings** |gear| in the top right corner of Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 오른쪽 상단 모서리에서 **설정** |gear|\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:26
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:36
msgid "Select **Desktop and mobile notifications**."
msgstr "**데스크톱 및 모바일 알림**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:28
msgid ""
"If **Send notifications for** is set to **Nothing**, then Mattermost "
"notifications are currently disabled. Select either the **All new "
"messages** or **Mentions, direct messages, and group messages** option "
"instead, and save your changes."
msgstr ""
"**알림 전송 대상**\\ 이 **없음**\\ 으로 설정되어 있으면 OKR.BEST 알림이 현재 "
"비활성화된 상태입니다. 대신 **모든 새 메시지** 또는 **멘션, 개인 메시지, 그룹 "
"메시지** 옵션을 선택하고 변경 사항을 저장하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:30
msgid "Select the Gear icon to enable Mattermost notifications."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 알림을 활성화하려면 톱니바퀴 아이콘을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:38
msgid ""
"If **Send notifications for** is set to **Nothing**, then Mattermost "
"notifications are currently disabled. Select either the **All new "
"messages** or **Mentions, direct messages, and group messages** option "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"**알림 전송 대상**\\ 이 **없음**\\ 으로 설정되어 있으면 OKR.BEST 알림이 현재 "
"비활성화된 상태입니다. 대신 **모든 새 메시지** 또는 **멘션, 개인 메시지, 그룹 "
"메시지** 옵션을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:42
msgid "Tap on your profile picture in the bottom right corner of Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 오른쪽 하단 모서리에서 프로필 사진을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:43
msgid "Tap **Settings** |gear|."
msgstr "**설정** |gear|\\ 을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:44
msgid "Tap **Notifications**."
msgstr "**알림**\\ 을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:45
msgid "Tap **Push Notifications**."
msgstr "**푸시 알림**\\ 을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:46
msgid ""
"Ensure that **All new messages** or **Mentions, direct messages, and "
"group messages** option is selected."
msgstr ""
"**모든 새 메시지** 또는 **멘션, 개인 메시지, 그룹 메시지** 옵션이 선택되어 "
"있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:47
msgid ""
"Under **Trigger push notifications when…**, select **Online, away or "
"offline** to always receive notifications."
msgstr ""
"**다음과 같은 경우 푸시 알림 트리거…** 아래에서 항상 알림을 받으려면 **온라인, "
"자리 비움 또는 오프라인**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:49
msgid "We recommend checking your Mattermost client settings next."
msgstr "다음으로 OKR.BEST 클라이언트 설정을 확인하는 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:52
msgid "Check your Mattermost client settings"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 클라이언트 설정 확인"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:56
msgid "Ensure notifications are enabled in your Mattermost server connection."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버 연결에서 알림이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select the Mattermost Server option in the top left of the desktop app, "
"then edit the server details."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱 왼쪽 상단에서 OKR.BEST 서버 옵션을 선택한 후 서버 세부 정보를 "
"편집하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:59
msgid "Under **Permissions**, enable **Notifications** and save your changes."
msgstr "**권한** 아래에서 **알림**\\ 을 활성화하고 변경 사항을 저장하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:61
msgid "Select the server option to enable Mattermost notifications."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 알림을 활성화하려면 서버 옵션을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:66
msgid ""
"If you prefer to use Mattermost in a web browser, you must grant "
"notification permissions for Mattermost in the web browser. If you don't,"
" the web browser can block you from receiving Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST를 사용하려면 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 "
"권한을 부여해야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 웹 브라우저가 OKR.BEST 알림 수신을 차단할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:68
msgid ""
"Select the **Chrome**, **Edge**, **Firefox**, or **Safari** tab below "
"based on your preferred web browser:"
msgstr ""
"선호하는 웹 브라우저에 따라 아래의 **Chrome**, **Edge**, **Firefox** 또는 "
"**Safari** 탭을 선택하세요:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:72
msgid "Grant notification permissions for Mattermost in your Chrome web browser."
msgstr "Chrome 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:74
msgid "From the Chrome menu, select **Settings**."
msgstr "Chrome 메뉴에서 **설정**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:75
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:94
msgid "Select **Privacy and Security** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **개인정보 및 보안**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:76
msgid "Expand **Site settings**."
msgstr "**사이트 설정**\\ 을 펼치세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:77
msgid "Under **Permissions**, expand **Notifications**."
msgstr "**권한** 아래에서 **알림**\\ 을 펼치세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable the **Sites can ask to send notifications** option, and add your "
"Mattermost workspace URL to the **Allowed to send notifications** list."
msgstr ""
"**사이트에서 알림 전송을 요청할 수 있음** 옵션을 활성화하고 **알림 전송 허용** "
"목록에 OKR.BEST 워크스페이스 URL을 추가하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:82
msgid "Grant notification permissions for Mattermost in your Edge web browser."
msgstr "Edge 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:84
msgid "From the Edge menu, select the **Settings and more (...)** option."
msgstr "Edge 메뉴에서 **설정 등(...)** 옵션을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:85
msgid "Select **Cookies and Site Permissions** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **쿠키 및 사이트 권한**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:86
msgid "Under **All Permissions**, **select Notifications**."
msgstr "**모든 권한** 아래에서 **알림을 선택**\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:87
msgid "Add your Mattermost workspace URL to the **Allow** section."
msgstr "**허용** 섹션에 OKR.BEST 워크스페이스 URL을 추가하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:91
msgid "Grant notification permissions for Mattermost in your Firefox web browser."
msgstr "Firefox 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:93
msgid "From the Firefox menu, select **Settings**."
msgstr "Firefox 메뉴에서 **설정**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:95
msgid ""
"Under **Permissions**, select the **Settings** option for "
"**Notifications**."
msgstr "**권한** 아래에서 **알림**\\ 에 대한 **설정** 옵션을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:96
msgid ""
"Enable notifications for your Mattermost workspace URL in the "
"**Permissions** list."
msgstr ""
"**권한** 목록에서 OKR.BEST 워크스페이스 URL에 대한 알림을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:100
msgid "Grant notification permissions for Mattermost in your Safari web browser."
msgstr "Safari 웹 브라우저에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:102
msgid "From the Safari menu, select **Preferences**."
msgstr "Safari 메뉴에서 **환경설정**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:103
msgid "Select **Websites** and select **Notifications** in the left pane."
msgstr "**웹사이트**\\ 를 선택하고 왼쪽 창에서 **알림**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:104
msgid "Enable notifications for your Mattermost site."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 사이트에 대한 알림을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:108
msgid ""
"Ensure that your mobile device isn't blocking device settings. Visit the "
"**Android** or **iOS** tab below based on your mobile device type."
msgstr ""
"모바일 기기가 기기 설정을 차단하고 있지 않은지 확인하세요. 모바일 기기 유형에 "
"따라 아래의 **Android** 또는 **iOS** 탭을 방문하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:112
msgid ""
"From Mattermost mobile v2.34, if your device has notifications disabled, "
"a banner displays in the Mattermost mobile **Settings > Notifications** "
"screen with a quick link to help you restore device-level notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 v2.34부터, 기기에서 알림이 비활성화되어 있으면 OKR.BEST 모바일 "
"**설정 > 알림** 화면에 기기 수준 알림을 복원하는 데 도움이 되는 바로 가기 링크가 "
"있는 배너가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:116
msgid ""
"Ensure that your Android device isn't blocking Mattermost notifications "
"by granting notification permission for Mattermost in device settings."
msgstr ""
"기기 설정에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하여 Android 기기가 OKR.BEST "
"알림을 차단하고 있지 않은지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:118
msgid "Open the Android **Settings app**, and tap **Application Manager**."
msgstr "Android **설정 앱**\\ 을 열고 **애플리케이션 관리자**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:119
msgid "Locate **Google Play Services** and enable notifications for it."
msgstr "**Google Play 서비스**\\ 를 찾아 알림을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:120
msgid "Locate **Mattermost** and enable notifications for it."
msgstr "**OKR.BEST**\\ 를 찾아 알림을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:122
msgid ""
"Also ensure that your Android device isn't set to **Do Not Disturb** mode"
" which is designed to block notifications. See the `Android help "
"<https://support.google.com/android/answer/9069335#zippy=%2Cturn-"
"interruptions-back-on>`_ documentation to learn more."
msgstr ""
"또한 Android 기기가 알림을 차단하도록 설계된 **방해 금지** 모드로 설정되어 있지 "
"않은지 확인하세요. 자세한 내용은 `Android 도움말 "
"<https://support.google.com/android/answer/9069335#zippy=%2Cturn-"
"interruptions-back-on>`_ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:126
msgid ""
"Ensure that your iOS device isn't blocking Mattermost notifications by "
"granting notification permission for Mattermost in device settings."
msgstr ""
"기기 설정에서 OKR.BEST에 대한 알림 권한을 부여하여 iOS 기기가 OKR.BEST 알림을 "
"차단하고 있지 않은지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:128
msgid "Open the iOS **Settings app** and tap **Notifications**."
msgstr "iOS **설정 앱**\\ 을 열고 **알림**\\ 을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:129
msgid "In the list of apps, tap **Mattermost**."
msgstr "앱 목록에서 **OKR.BEST**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:130
msgid ""
"Enable the **Allow notifications** toggle and set **Notification "
"Delivery** to **Immediate Delivery**."
msgstr ""
"**알림 허용** 토글을 활성화하고 **알림 전달**\\ 을 **즉시 전달**\\ 로 "
"설정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:132
msgid ""
"Also ensure that your iOS device isn't set to **Do Not Disturb** mode or "
"a **Focus mode** designed to block notifications. See the `iOS support "
"<https://support.apple.com/en-ca/105112>`_ documentation to learn more."
msgstr ""
"또한 iOS 기기가 알림을 차단하도록 설계된 **방해 금지** 모드나 **집중 모드**로 "
"설정되어 있지 않은지 확인하세요. 자세한 내용은 `iOS 지원 "
"<https://support.apple.com/en-ca/105112>`_ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:134
msgid "We recommend checking your operating system settings next."
msgstr "다음으로 운영 체제 설정을 확인하는 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:137
msgid "Check your Operating System settings"
msgstr "운영 체제 설정 확인"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:139
msgid ""
"The operating system you're running Mattermost on can also block "
"Mattermost notifications. Select the **Linux**, **macOS**, or **Windows**"
" tab based on your operating system:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST를 실행하는 운영 체제도 OKR.BEST 알림을 차단할 수 있습니다. 운영 체제에 "
"따라 **Linux**, **macOS** 또는 **Windows** 탭을 선택하세요:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:143
msgid ""
"If you're using Mattermost on a Windows machine, you must enable "
"notifications from Mattermost and turn off both Do Not Disturb mode and "
"Focus Assist. If you don't, Windows can block you from receiving "
"Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"Windows 컴퓨터에서 OKR.BEST를 사용하는 경우, OKR.BEST의 알림을 활성화하고 방해 "
"금지 모드와 집중 지원을 모두 꺼야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 Windows가 OKR.BEST 알림 "
"수신을 차단할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:145
msgid "Open **Windows Settings** and go to **System > Notifications & actions**."
msgstr "**Windows 설정**\\ 을 열고 **시스템 > 알림 및 작업**\\ 으로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:146
msgid "Ensure that **Get notifications from apps and other senders**, is enabled."
msgstr "**앱 및 기타 보낸 사람으로부터 알림 받기**\\ 가 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:147
msgid "Find Mattermost in the list and enable notifications."
msgstr "목록에서 OKR.BEST를 찾아 알림을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:149
msgid ""
"Also ensure that Windows’ **Do Not Disturb** mode and **Focus Assist** is"
" turned off. See the Windows support docmentation on `Do Not Disturb mode"
" <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/turn-off-notifications-in-"
"windows-during-certain-times-81ed1b25-809b-741d-549c-7696474d15d3>`_ and "
"`Focus Assist <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/make-it-"
"easier-to-focus-on-tasks-0d259fd9-e9d0-702c-c027-007f0e78eaf2>`_ to learn"
" more."
msgstr ""
"또한 Windows의 **방해 금지** 모드와 **집중 지원**\\ 이 꺼져 있는지 확인하세요. "
"자세한 내용은 `방해 금지 모드 <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows"
"/turn-off-notifications-in-windows-during-certain-times-81ed1b25-809b-741d-"
"549c-7696474d15d3>`_ 및 `집중 지원 <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us"
"/windows/make-it-easier-to-focus-on-tasks-0d259fd9-e9d0-702c-c027-"
"007f0e78eaf2>`_\\ 에 대한 Windows 지원 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:153
msgid ""
"If you're using Mattermost on a Linux machine, you must enable pop-up "
"notifications from Mattermost and turn off Do Not Disturb mode. If you "
"don't, Linux can block you from receiving Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"Linux 컴퓨터에서 OKR.BEST를 사용하는 경우, OKR.BEST의 팝업 알림을 활성화하고 "
"방해 금지 모드를 꺼야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 Linux가 OKR.BEST 알림 수신을 차단할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:155
msgid "Open **Settings**, then go to **Notifications**."
msgstr "**설정**\\ 을 연 다음 **알림**\\ 으로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:156
msgid "Enable the **Show Pop-up Notifications** option."
msgstr "**팝업 알림 표시** 옵션을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:157
msgid ""
"Enable the **Show Notification Center** to review and manage your "
"Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 알림을 검토하고 관리하려면 **알림 센터 표시**\\ 를 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:159
msgid "Also ensure that **Do Not Disturb** mode is turned off."
msgstr "또한 **방해 금지** 모드가 꺼져 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:163
msgid ""
"If you're using Mattermost on a macOS machine, you must enable "
"application notifications for Mattermost and turn off focus mode. If you "
"don't, macOS can block you from receiving Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"macOS 컴퓨터에서 OKR.BEST를 사용하는 경우, OKR.BEST에 대한 애플리케이션 알림을 "
"활성화하고 집중 모드를 꺼야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 macOS가 OKR.BEST 알림 수신을 "
"차단할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:165
msgid "Open **System Settings** and go to **Notifications**."
msgstr "**시스템 설정**\\ 을 열고 **알림**\\ 으로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:166
msgid "Under **Application Notifications**, ensure notifications are enabled."
msgstr "**애플리케이션 알림** 아래에서 알림이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:168
msgid ""
"Also ensure that macOS’ **Focus mode** is turned off. See the Apple "
"Support `Focus mode <https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/mac-"
"help/mchl999b7c1a/mac>`_ documentation to learn more."
msgstr ""
"또한 macOS의 **집중 모드**가 꺼져 있는지 확인하세요. 자세한 내용은 Apple 지원 "
"`집중 모드 <https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/mac-"
"help/mchl999b7c1a/mac>`_ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:171
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:174
msgid "What determines if a desktop notification should be triggered?"
msgstr "데스크톱 알림을 트리거할지는 무엇이 결정하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:176
msgid ""
"Desktop notifications are triggered under to following conditions. Click "
"to expand the flow chart."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 알림은 다음 조건에서 트리거됩니다. 흐름도를 펼치려면 클릭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:178
msgid ""
"A flow diagram shows how Mattermost Desktop App notifications are "
"triggered when a message is posted."
msgstr ""
"메시지가 게시될 때 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 알림이 어떻게 트리거되는지 보여주는 "
"흐름도입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:184
msgid "What determines if an email notification should be triggered?"
msgstr "이메일 알림을 트리거할지는 무엇이 결정하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:186
msgid ""
"Email notifications are triggered under to following conditions. Click to"
" expand the flow chart."
msgstr ""
"이메일 알림은 다음 조건에서 트리거됩니다. 흐름도를 펼치려면 클릭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:188
msgid ""
"A flow diagram shows how Mattermost email notifications are triggered "
"when a message is posted."
msgstr ""
"메시지가 게시될 때 OKR.BEST 이메일 알림이 어떻게 트리거되는지 보여주는 "
"흐름도입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:194
msgid "What determines if a mobile push notification should be triggered?"
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림을 트리거할지는 무엇이 결정하나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:196
msgid ""
"Mobile push notifications are triggered under to following conditions. "
"Click to expand the flow chart."
msgstr ""
"모바일 푸시 알림은 다음 조건에서 트리거됩니다. 흐름도를 펼치려면 클릭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:198
msgid ""
"A flow diagram shows how Mattermost mobile push notifications are "
"triggered when a message is posted."
msgstr ""
"메시지가 게시될 때 OKR.BEST 모바일 푸시 알림이 어떻게 트리거되는지 보여주는 "
"흐름도입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:206
msgid "Are mobile push notifications free?"
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림은 무료인가요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:208
msgid ""
"Yes, push notifications are free if you compile your own `push-proxy "
"service <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-push-proxy>`__. Push "
"notifications are also free if you use the hosted Test Push Notification "
"Service (TPNS) provided by Mattermost, Inc."
msgstr ""
"예, 직접 `push-proxy service <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"push-proxy>`__\\ 를 컴파일하면 푸시 알림은 무료입니다. Mattermost, Inc.에서 "
"제공하는 호스팅형 테스트 푸시 알림 서비스(TPNS)를 사용하는 경우에도 푸시 알림은 "
"무료입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:210
msgid ""
"TPNS, hosted at `https://push-test.mattermost.com <https://push-"
"test.mattermost.com>`_, offers transport-level encryption, but not "
"production-level service level agreements (SLAs)."
msgstr ""
"`https://push-test.mattermost.com <https://push-test.mattermost.com>`_\\ "
"에서 호스팅되는 TPNS는 전송 수준 암호화를 제공하지만, 프로덕션 수준의 서비스 수준 "
"계약(SLA)은 제공하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:212
msgid ""
"If you need production-level SLAs for push notifications, you can either "
"compile your own push-proxy service, with your own key, or you can use a "
"paid option and become a Mattermost Professional subscriber `agreeing to "
"our Conditions of Use <https://mattermost.com/terms-of-use/>`_, which "
"enables you to use a production-level Hosted Push Notification Service "
"(HPNS) at ``https://push.mattermost.com``."
msgstr ""
"푸시 알림에 대해 프로덕션 수준 SLA가 필요한 경우, 직접 키로 자체 push-proxy "
"service를 컴파일하거나, 유료 옵션을 사용하여 `이용 약관에 동의 "
"<https://mattermost.com/terms-of-use/>`_\\ 하고 Mattermost Professional "
"구독자가 되어 ``https://push.mattermost.com``\\ 에서 프로덕션 수준 호스팅 푸시 "
"알림 서비스(HPNS)를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:214
msgid ""
"Learn more about :ref:`our push notification service <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:enable push "
"notifications>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`푸시 알림 서비스 <administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"configuration-settings:enable push notifications>`\\ 에 대해 자세히 "
"알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications.rst:216
msgid ""
"`Book a live demo <https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_  or `talk to a"
" Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to explore "
"tailored solutions for your organization's secure collaboration needs. Or"
" try Mattermost yourself with a `1-hour preview <https://mattermost.com"
"/sign-up/>`_ for instant access to a live sandbox environment."
msgstr ""
"`라이브 데모 예약 <https://mattermost.com/request-demo/>`_\\ 또는 `Mattermost "
"전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 을 통해 조직의 안전한 "
"협업 요구에 맞는 맞춤형 솔루션을 살펴보세요. 또는 `1시간 미리 보기 "
"<https://mattermost.com/sign-up/>`_\\ 로 Mattermost를 직접 사용해 보고 라이브 "
"샌드박스 환경에 즉시 액세스하세요."

